["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why straight dating feels bleak heteropessimism hopeful pessimism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-grayarea-异性恋悲观主义-直女困境的真实与表演/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/94d1e3cbb8f9e58a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>直女約會悲觀不是矯情，是政治倒退與經濟依附</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sarah Jones 認為，直女對約會男性的尷尬與悲觀，既是真實感受也是表演，背後是政治倒退、經濟依附與社交媒體強化的複雜現實。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">異性戀悲觀主義</span><span class=\"tag\">性別政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Historic El Niño Is Coming That Could Cost the World Trillions ENSO Teleconnection RONI Level effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-oddlots-厄尔尼诺不是短期冲击-而是永久性增长损失/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">55:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>厄爾尼諾不是短期衝擊，而是永久性增長損失</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">厄爾尼諾不只是短期天氣衝擊，研究顯示它會永久壓低經濟增長軌跡，一次強厄爾尼諾五年內可造成數萬億美元損失，且我們並未適應。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">厄爾尼諾</span><span class=\"tag\">氣候經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lindy Teammate: Flo Crivello on Multiplayer Agents, Memory &amp; Why He&#x27;d Ban the Chinese Models He Uses hydration context bucket centary tree TOON hypothesis driven retrieval per-user LoRA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-14-cogrev-lindy-全线跑在-deepseek-上-创始人主张封禁中国模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cde4d0762bd9b4a2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0814</span></div>\n<h2>Lindy 全線跑 DeepSeek，創始人卻主張封禁中國模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Flo Crivello 說 Lindy 的 agent 現在整條鏈路的 driver 就是 DeepSeek，而他同時主張全行業一起被禁——因為競爭對手會用，他就不得不用，寧願協調解決這個囚徒困境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">agent 記憶</span><span class=\"tag\">上下文工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"SK hynix and the HBM Revolution HBM TSV TC-NCF MR-MUF HBM-PIM ADR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-asianometry-sk-hynix-靠-hbm-翻身-客户战略赢过周期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/143ca5977a616036-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>SK hynix 翻身靠的不是 HBM 技術，而是客戶關係</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">SK hynix 的翻身不是押中 HBM 技術，而是押中客戶關係與長期投入；Samsung 押注 PIM 邊緣推理，恰好把 ChatGPT 時刻的唯一供應商位置讓給了對手。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半導體</span><span class=\"tag\">HBM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Chess.com Teaches US About Superhuman Capabilities, with CEO Erik Allebest Stockfish Leela Chess Zero mittens bot ELO secondary\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-nopriors-ai-让国际象棋变无聊后-又让它更好看了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cdff3faf801808d4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">46:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓國際象棋變無聊後，又讓它更好看了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Stockfish 時代棋手模仿完美引擎，比賽變得沉悶；神經網絡引擎下出激進非常規的棋，反而把人類棋力推得更高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國際象棋</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 與人類技能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Chelsea Finn: This is the State of the Art in Robotics compositional generalization subgoal image time-to-success RL post-training\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-ycsp-机器人单模型开箱追平微调专才-组合泛化已有强证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/04a76cf95c327656-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">58:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>機器人單模型開箱打平微調專才，組合泛化已有強證據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">機器人單模型開箱追平微調專才，尤其能在從未見過的機械臂上組合泛化，這都依賴用提示詞馴服低質異構數據；瓶頸正在轉向可靠性、速度和物理分發。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"We Solve the 49ers Viral Conspiracy Theory milligauss deep story\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-sciencevs-变电站不背这口锅-49人队伤病阴谋论被拆穿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>49人隊傷病怪變電站？劑量差40倍，數據也不支持</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">宣稱變電站電磁波導致49人隊傷病狂潮的陰謀論，被輻射專家和傷病數據庫逐條證偽：劑量遠低於安全線、引用的論文不合格、2014年擴建的是另一座電站，數據也顯示他們並非最慘。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NFL</span><span class=\"tag\">傷病數據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Transcranial magnetic stimulation and the future of psychiatry | Corey Keller TMS theta burst stimulation cortical excitability limbic subgenual cingulate\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-fromourneurons-tms-治抑郁只有五成有效-卡在不懂它怎么改变大脑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/372ab8e78a5e10ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">46:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From Our Neurons to Yours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>TMS 治抑鬱只有五成有效：卡在不懂它怎麼改變大腦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TMS 已進入臨床卻還是「黑箱」，機理不清導致療效停留在 50%。用癲癇病人顱內電極取到神經元的ground truth，下一步是磨出腦電 biomarker，把治療從猜參數變成閉環優化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">TMS</span><span class=\"tag\">神經調控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bill Bernstein: The Money Decisions That Actually Matter | Rational Reminder 422 hedonic treadmill self-determination theory TIPS ladder hyperscalers Easterlin paradox sinning a little\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-rationalreminder-想给孙辈留财富-范德比尔特家族聚会里没有一个百万富翁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/473a88561804f746-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>想給孫輩留財富？范德比爾特家族聚會裡沒有一個百萬富翁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">財富傳承幾乎註定失敗：繼承人每代翻倍稀釋、繳稅、攀比消費；真正該做的是趁孩子三四十歲用「溫暖的手」把錢給出去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富傳承</span><span class=\"tag\">退休規劃</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Archive: Coffee Sufis Levant Company Lloyd&#x27;s List Robusta Moka pot espresso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-inourtime-咖啡因催生了近代商业情报网络与社交空间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3f143ddc011b622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">56:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>咖啡不讓人醉，反而催生了近代商業情報網絡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">咖啡最早為蘇菲派祈禱提供清醒；它不讓人醉，反而讓人長談，於是咖啡館成為商業情報交換所，進而通過奴隸種植園和品牌化重塑全球經濟。今天關於拿鐵的爭論，仍寫在這段五百年的歷史裡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">咖啡</span><span class=\"tag\">商業史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Essentials: How to Optimize Female Hormone Health for Vitality &amp; Longevity | Dr. Sara Gottfried SHBG CGM PCOS FDG PET HPA axis CAC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-huberman-女性激素真相-睾酮流失与围绝经期脑代谢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a1ac1c82ed5e5947-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">38:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>女性睪酮每年降1%，圍絕經期大腦代謝降20%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">女性應在 20 多歲建立激素基線，睪酮每年約降 1%；口服避孕藥在降卵巢癌風險的同時可能讓陰蒂縮小最多 20%；圍絕經期大腦葡萄糖代謝平均降 20%，潮熱是疾病信號而非小麻煩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">女性激素</span><span class=\"tag\">睪酮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Trucking Is Booming Again, And Drivers Aren&#x27;t Happy About It non-domiciled CDL ELD (electronic logging device) freight broker FMCSA safety rating spot vs contract rate owner operator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-oddlots-这轮卡车运价上涨来自供给被砍-不是需求回来了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">46:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>卡車運價暴漲不是需求回來了，是供給被執法砍掉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英語能力執法、non-domiciled CDL 收緊和最高法院經紀商責任判決同時抽走運力，把三年低谷終結的不是貨量回升，而是入行門檻被結構性抬高——下一次需求爆發時市場已無法像 COVID 那樣迅速補供給。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">卡車運輸</span><span class=\"tag\">監管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The blatant betrayal that erased the Tupperware queen from history subversive domesticity burp Wonder Bowl Jubilee\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-throughline-特百惠女王遭公然背叛-被美国历史抹去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6899c998b8f2c10a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>特百惠女王被解僱後，公司埋掉了她的書</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Brownie Wise 用「家庭主婦聚會」把特百惠變成美國國民品牌，卻因名氣蓋過發明家而被解僱、銷燬生平記錄，直到 2016 年公園命名才被官方承認。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">銷售革命</span><span class=\"tag\">女性職場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"LLMs and the economics of Evil, Inc., with Manish Goregaokar BEC money mule AML Regulation E desk name supply chain attack\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-complexsys-大模型把骗局工业化-单点登录成了总开关/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/03fbe8332bb0a87a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>大模型把騙局工業化，單點登錄成了總開關</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當偽造面試、監控郵箱、合成語音的成本趨近於零，任何人的 SSO 賬號都可能被悄無聲息接管；銀行讓誰承擔損失，比教會用戶識別釣魚更關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">LLM</span><span class=\"tag\">反詐騙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Romulus &amp; Remus Rex Pomerium Casa Romuli Lupa\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-13-ancients-罗马人清楚建城神话是虚构的-但照样当外交工具/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9395e3e4c90e300-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬人明知建城神話是假的，卻拿它當外交工具</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅馬的起源神話不是刻在石頭上的信史，而是羅馬人用來談判、整合異族和消化內戰的彈性敘事；考古證據甚至與 753 年建城說直接衝突。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬史</span><span class=\"tag\">神話政治學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"696. Elizabeth I vs The Catholics: Killing the Queen of Scots (Part 6) Bond of Association Act for the Queen&#x27;s Safety presence chamber Star Chamber cipher\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-restishistory-玛丽之死背后的真博弈-伊丽莎白想要暗杀-不想签字/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>伊麗莎白想暗殺瑪麗，卻被迫簽字處決</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伊麗莎白一世不想公開處決瑪麗，只盼有人按《聯合盟約》私下殺她；樞密院堅持法律程序，最終在女王簽字後仍違背其意願，把死刑令連夜送往福瑟林蓋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">伊麗莎白一世</span><span class=\"tag\">瑪麗·斯圖亞特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"150. 對英偉達研究副總裁劉洺堉的4小時訪談：功夫、Cosmos 3、開源世界模型、黃仁勳、你不需要擊敗所有對手 Physical AI World Foundation Model Multimodal Transformer Dual-tower\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-zhangxiaojun-英伟达研究副总裁-模型竞争终局是生态-不是击败对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/920e2373c894c74b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:36:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達研究副總裁：模型終局是生態，不是擊敗對手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">劉洺堉：模型能力終將趨同，英偉達做開源世界模型不是競爭而是鋪路；物理 AI 的 GPT 時刻未到，但條件正在匯聚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Cosmos</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Noctohabitology (SLEEP PROCRASTINATION) with Vanessa “Nessy” Hill Sleep procrastination Circadian rhythm Cortisol\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-ologies-睡前拖延不是懒-是白天没了自我时间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>睡前拖延不是懶，是白天沒了自我時間</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多數人睡前拖延只有半小時，真正問題是白天缺自主權；藍光眼鏡效果有限，室內燈光影響更大；自我同情比強迫早睡更能改善睡眠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">睡眠科學</span><span class=\"tag\">行為心理學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Episode 198: Blessing or curse? Dawn grills Ken on listeners’ toughest AI questions in this all-AI AMA confabulation Section 230 DABUS distillation agentic reasoning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-stemtalk-ai-公司不该拿-230-条免责-幻觉也不是等着修的-bug/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5d13d2b13ccdb765-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">STEM-Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>AI 公司不該拿 230 條免責，幻覺也不是等著修的 bug</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ken 認為生成式 AI 合成新內容、源頭在模型本身，所以更像發布者而非中立平臺；而幻覺更接近神經心理學裡的 confabulation，是內建於工作方式的風險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Stop being skeptical about AI for development with Charity Majors harness conformance testing slop SEV zero doom trolling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-pragmatic-ai-写代码不必逐行读-但信任必须重建/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5f2a55d9c9f0838c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>AI 寫代碼不必逐行讀，但信任必須重建</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2025 的 AI 相當於雲的 2010；真正的問題不是是否要讀 AI 寫的代碼，而是何時不讀，以及怎樣用測試、eval 和 on-call 成本把信任重建回來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 編程</span><span class=\"tag\">代碼審查</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The probiotic bacteria engineered to treat diabetes GLP-1 (glucagon-like peptide-1) Molecular brake Proba-3\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-naturepod-活菌当药-让糖尿病治疗随血糖自动开关/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">19:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>糖尿病藥隨血糖自動開關：活菌按需分泌GLP1</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科學家改造大腸桿菌，使其在高血糖時自動分泌GLP1，在小鼠和獼猴中改善了血糖控制；雖離人體試驗尚遠，但開啟了「按需給藥」的活體藥物想像。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">益生菌</span><span class=\"tag\">糖尿病</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"I wrote an AI textbook — how long until AI can do it better? RLVR RLHF inference-time scaling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-interconnects-ai写作停滞-长文非虚构是模型能力的试金石/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba2952184132ad60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">12:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>AI寫作停滯：長文非虛構是模型能力的試金石</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型在長文非虛構寫作上進步緩慢，暴露了其組織知識能力的缺陷，這比代碼和數學的進步更值得警惕，因為它關乎AI能否解決開放科學問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI寫作</span><span class=\"tag\">非虛構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Frederick Walton and the Invention of Linoleum linoleum frizzing Camptulicon Lincrusta-Walton\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-stuffmissed-油毡之父没注册商标-连名字都成了公共财产/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>油氈之父沒註冊商標，連名字都成了公共財產</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Frederick Walton 發明了 linoleum，卻因沒註冊商標而失去名字；真正定義行業標準的技術，來自他手下的員工 C.F. Leak。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">發明史</span><span class=\"tag\">油氈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Daron Acemoglu on Liberalism, Automation, and the Educated Elite non-domination task-based framework pro worker AI agentic AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-12-tyler-精英化杀死自由主义-自动化并非元凶/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/16eb2a1660e908ef-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">55:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0812</span></div>\n<h2>自由主義死於教育精英，而非自動化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿西莫格魯拆穿三重迷思：自由主義死於教育精英而非自動化；AI 生產力十年難爆發；監管算法不算限制言論，親工人 AI 才是方向。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動化</span><span class=\"tag\">勞動份額</span>\n</div></div></a>"]